{"root":"ganggu","ipa":"/ɡaŋɡu/","core":"干扰、打扰、妨碍","pos":["动词"],"scenes":["高频","工作","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ɡaŋɡu/","zh":"干扰，打扰，妨碍","phrases":[{"t":"jangan ganggu","zh":"别打扰"},{"t":"mengganggu ketenangan","zh":"扰乱安宁"},{"t":"gangguan jiwa","zh":"精神障碍"}],"examples":[{"t":"Maaf, saya tidak bermaksud untuk mengganggu Anda.","zh":"抱歉，我无意打扰您。"},{"t":"Suara bising itu sangat mengganggu konsentrasi saya.","zh":"那嘈杂的声音非常干扰我的注意力。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"ganggu","ipa":"/ɡaŋɡu/","zh":"干扰（原型词）","phrase":{"t":"gangguan teknis","zh":"技术故障"},"example":{"t":"Jangan ganggu dia saat sedang bekerja.","zh":"他工作时别打扰他。"}},{"w":"mengganggu","ipa":"/məŋɡaŋɡu/","zh":"正在干扰，打扰某人","phrase":{"t":"sangat mengganggu","zh":"非常烦人"},"example":{"t":"Perilakunya mulai mengganggu orang lain.","zh":"他的行为开始干扰到其他人了。"}},{"w":"terganggu","ipa":"/tərɡaŋɡu/","zh":"受到干扰的，被打扰的","phrase":{"t":"tidur terganggu","zh":"睡眠受到干扰"},"example":{"t":"Konsentrasinya terganggu oleh suara musik.","zh":"他的注意力被音乐声打断了。"}},{"w":"gangguan","ipa":"/ɡaŋɡuan/","zh":"干扰，障碍，故障","phrase":{"t":"gangguan sinyal","zh":"信号干扰"},"example":{"t":"Ada gangguan pada sistem komputer kami.","zh":"我们的电脑系统出现了故障。"}},{"w":"pengganggu","ipa":"/pəŋɡaŋɡu/","zh":"干扰者，捣乱的人","phrase":{"t":"pengganggu ketertiban","zh":"扰乱秩序者"},"example":{"t":"Dia dianggap sebagai pengganggu di kelas.","zh":"他被认为是班里的捣乱分子。"}}],"derSlugs":["ganggu","mengganggu","terganggu","gangguan","pengganggu"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-25T09:46:03.078Z","src":"base"}